        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>口腔特殊检查</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Heiti SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n    max-width: 570px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 18px 22px 30px 22px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n  h1.doc-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 4px 0 6px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  p.subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  h2.section {\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 8px 0 10px 0;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .sub-head {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    margin: 6px 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  p.line {\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <h1 class=\"doc-title\">口腔特殊检查</h1>\n  <p class=\"subtitle\">（抽取其中一项并记录检查结果）</p>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section\">1、牙髓活力测试</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"sub-head\">热测</div>\n\n  <p class=\"line\">① 医嘱：您好，我现在为您进行牙髓活力测试热测，可能感到热或痛，如有不适，请举左手示意。</p>\n\n  <p class=\"line\">② 器械选择：热牙胶棒、酒精灯、打火机、凡士林</p>\n\n  <p class=\"line\">(1) 首先，隔湿患牙及对照牙；</p>\n\n  <p class=\"line\">(2) 顺序：先测对照牙（首选患牙的同领同名牙，其次为患牙的对颌对侧同名牙）再测可疑牙，低于 10 度为冷刺激，高于 60 度为热刺激。</p>\n\n  <p class=\"line\">(3) 老师请帮忙点燃酒精灯，谢谢你老师。</p>\n\n  <p class=\"line\">(4) 在牙面均匀涂布一层凡士林，加热牙胶棒。置于对照牙唇颊面中 1/3 处。询问患者有无不适。然后再将牙胶棒置于患牙唇颊面中 1/3处，询问患者有无不适。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"sub-head\">冷测</div>\n\n  <p class=\"line\">器械选择：小冰棒或氯乙烷</p>\n\n  <p class=\"line\">① 选用小冰棒，将小冰棒置于掌心，稍加捂化，挤出冰头，置于患者对照牙唇颊面中 1/3，再测患牙。</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
